ile the CEO\'s responsiveness is noted, the post reveals a fundamental reliability issue with their core product (rate limiting causing work loss), and their solution (quota increase) appears reactive rather than addressing systemic infrastructure problems\\u2014a critical red flag for quality-first enterprises where downtime directly impacts revenue and client deliverables.", "E3": "SCORE: 0.3\\nREASON: While the responsive customer service is noted, the post lacks strategic depth, co-development details, or enterprise-scale reliability commitments that would signal a serious long-term partnership opportunity for C-level evaluation."}'}

